        "message": "=<h2>High-Priority Lead Alert</h2>\n<p>A high-scoring lead has submitted the form. Here are the details:</p>\n\n<h3>Contact Information</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Name:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Full Name'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Email Address'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Company:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Company Name'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Company Size:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Company Size'] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Project Details</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Budget Range:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Budget Range'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Timeline:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Timeline'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Project Description:</strong> {{ $('Lead Generation Form').first().json['Tell us about your project or needs'] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>AI Qualification</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Score:</strong> {{ $json.output.score }}/100</li>\n<li><strong>Priority:</strong> {{ $json.output.priority }}</li>\n<li><strong>Reasoning:</strong> {{ $json.output.reasoning }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Next Step:</strong> Consider reaching out to this lead promptly to schedule a consultation.</p>",
